            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nThis is by design: anchor path for `MiniFiles.open()` should be a present path on disk. There is no fallbacks and there will be no dialog with suggestions. Either use explicit call [which includes directory](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/64e95aa77587d04f97a5579b2106a82a08a7d968/doc/mini-files.txt#L694-L708) or save file prior to opening 'mini.files' explorer.\r\n\r\nClosing as duplicate of #1247, #840, and #848.",
